#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf-apps/plasma-activities-stats.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>plasma-activities-stats</application> package provides "
"access to the usage data collected by the KDE Activities system.  It is "
"normally built with <xref linkend=\"plasma-build\"/>, but it is included "
"here because it is needed for <xref linkend=\"kio-extras\"/>."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>plasma-activities-stats</application> fornece acesso "
"aos dados de uso coletados pelo sistema KDE Activities. Ele normalmente é "
"construído com <xref linkend=\"plasma-build\"/>, mas está incluído aqui "
"porque é necessária para <xref linkend=\"kio-extras\"/>."

